                        "review": "Servers cannot be reached.\nGame should be delisted.\n\n\nKiitsu is super bad game, as even in the menu, when you go to \"Options\" and then \"Resolution\", you cannot press Esc. You either click resolution or quit game.\n\nThen, the game is mixture of French and English.\nYou get cutscene on top of current game - therefore you will get some messages during cutscene, like \"You fell from too high\" (not exact wording, but still)...\n\nThen, problem is French AZERTY, so to walk forward you press \"A\", not \"W\". Cannot be rebinded. Not adjusted to more popular keyboard layout...\n\nThat makes me think of questionable design.\nAlso, inventory just does not work.",
